      "machineHash": "f24fa41b65daff45c37b409f2c2126ec51670c422bddca29212bedd2978e3167",
      "machineText": "*Wails menerapkan `WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER=1` secara otomatis* saat mendeteksi modul kernel NVIDIA (`/sys/module/nvidia`), sehingga sebagian besar pengguna tidak perlu melakukan apa pun.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "*Wails applies `WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER=1` automatically* when it detects the NVIDIA kernel m…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:30Z"
